{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"739055752647540816","content":"Leaf climbs up the side of the Rockman's partially constructed wall. Usually she'd be running headfirst into the forest to protect her friends, but she's beginning to realize that even things like that come from a place of fear. This time she tries something different. She sits overlooking the town. She takes a deep breath and closes her eyes. Her hand goes to her holy symbol, waiting. Trusting they'll be ok. That they'll make the right choice. And that if not, Mello will give her a sign.","created_at":"2020-08-08T01:47:13.339000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741472556397363210","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
