{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"739055752647540816","content":"Leaf starts idly balancing on the top of the wall, hoping from foot to foot to stretch her legs. \"If they can convince the whole island to hate us... There must be a way to do the opposite...\"","created_at":"2020-08-08T06:21:09.998000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741541496741822547","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
