{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"739055752647540816","content":"She looks him over, still worried. \"You don't have to tell me if you don't want to, but if something happened that you need to talk through, you know I'll listen, right?\"","created_at":"2020-08-08T07:38:57.142000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741561072162439219","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"739055752647540816","content":"\"The hags did not offer any kind of diplomacy... None of the creatures here will. Our colony is alone.\"","created_at":"2020-08-08T07:42:53.124000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741562061942685719","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"739055752647540816","content":"\"You... you really think so?\" She sits down next to him, thinking things over. \"Well,\" she pauses \"Well for one, we're not alone. We have Mello!\" Leaf smiles \"and if the island will listen to the hags, maybe it'll listen to us too? Or maybe it'll listen to Mello? She's still a goddess of nature after all.\"","created_at":"2020-08-08T07:50:24.743000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741563956170194964","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"739055752647540816","content":"Rockman shrugs \"I have no idea... \" he falls back and looks up at the night sky","created_at":"2020-08-08T07:54:56.377000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741565095485636719","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"739055752647540816","content":"Leaf falls back as well. She's quiet for a minute before finally asking, \"Are you ok? I mean really, are you ok? It's... It's alright to not be strong all the time...\" She trails off, realizing the irony in her saying that, trying to accept it for herself.","created_at":"2020-08-08T08:01:59.410000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741566869814902814","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"739055752647540816","content":"Rockman replies to Leaf in goblin || \"For you, i have to be. For you I must.\" || He trails off staring at the night sky.","created_at":"2020-08-08T08:04:31.743000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741567508745814066","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"739055752647540816","content":"She replies in Goblin, ||\"No... Just be yourself. You can't be strong all the time. No one can. Trust me, I tried and it almost broke me.\"||","created_at":"2020-08-08T08:11:04.429000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741569155790274693","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"739055752647540816","content":"He sits up \"How so?\" He looks at her slightly excited to learn more about her past.","created_at":"2020-08-08T08:12:54.877000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741569619042631760","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"739055752647540816","content":"\"Well... I guess a part of me was always like that. Wanting to be strong. Melora gave me powers, so I have to use them for good. Make her proud...\" She switches to Goblin, ||\"Prove she didn't make a mistake in chosing me... But on the sub, things started happening. Whispers and closed doors. And all of a sudden people needed me to be strong. Or at least that's what I thought. So I started using my spells to try to... To force people to tell the truth. I thought that was me being strong. Instead I was just running around in circles. I didn't know who to trust. I used the spell on a lot of people... Most of them with permission. Most...\"|| She trails off, thinking about how she hasn't seen Goan since the Command spell. || \"I- I even considered using it on Ebuc. I even hid and followed him without me knowing...\"|| She looks down, ashamed. ||\"I just wanted answers. I thought answers would make me strong. But at the end of it all, I was just exhausted and confused. The ship sank... And that was the end of it.\"||","created_at":"2020-08-08T08:33:15.153000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-08T08:38:55.948000Z","id":"741574737251139596","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"739055752647540816","content":"Rockman smiles \"you were strong. From what I've heard, you helped Ebuc decide to be good. You gave him the courage he needed.\" He pauses a moment and continues in goblin. || \" You gave him purpose, hope, and most of all... You taught him love. There isn't a doubt in my mind that he chose to fight that... Monster, to keep you safe. Or at least try to keep you safe.\" ||","created_at":"2020-08-08T08:45:14.422000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741577754084114474","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"739055752647540816","content":"||\"But... But that's the thing. I know it's not right, but I can't help but think that if I'd done things differently, he would be here... But at the same time, if something were to happen to me, I don't want you to carry that same pain...\"||","created_at":"2020-08-08T08:51:36.087000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741579354902888499","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"739055752647540816","content":"\"If you hadn't have done that... I don't know what could have happened. He may be here, he may not.\" He shrugs \"What i do know is that you are Good. And you were worth protecting to him. I shall honor that and continue to do as such... Little Leaf\" he smiles at her.","created_at":"2020-08-08T09:01:37.189000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741581876107411476","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"739055752647540816","content":"Leaf smiles, a bit sad. \"You keep saying things like that... That I'm \"special\". I just try to do what I think is right. Help people. Isn't that what most people want too? I don't see how that's so special...\" She sighs, looking up at the stars.","created_at":"2020-08-08T09:10:26.431000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741584095909380107","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"739055752647540816","content":"\"You are special indeed.\" He looks up to the stars as he lays down, his head beside hers. \"You did more than try and help people. I think you saved them in the end.\" He extends his arm out to the night sky, speaking in goblin. || \"You became a symbol of hope, Ebuc's savior.\" ||","created_at":"2020-08-08T09:20:08.356000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741586536679604225","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"739055752647540816","content":"\"I- I guess so...\" She extends her own hand towards the sky, the sapphire ring catching the light and sparkling. \"I know I say this a lot, but Thank you. Really.\"","created_at":"2020-08-08T09:29:39.445000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741588932000743445","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
